  "description": "Caching layer for Bodu.Globalization.Calendar. Provides CachingNotableDateService, a decorator that wraps any INotableDateService and serves computed notable dates from a per-territory, per-civil-year cache (in-memory or one TOML/JSON file per territory), recording when each year was computed and refreshing on a configurable time-to-live or a resource-version change. Includes the dependency-injection registration (AddCachedNotableDateService) on IServiceCollection.",
